<title>USA: AirNet Systems to buy back 600,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>AirNet Systems to buy back 600,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>AirNet Systems Inc said on Tuesday that its board approved the repurchase of up to 600,000 common shares over the next 12 to 18 months.</p>
<p>The company has about 12.6 million shares outstanding, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>AirNet said in a statement that the shares will be used to fund its 1996 Incentive Stock Plan and possible future acquisitions.</p>
</text>
